     6768           end.
     6769           for each temp_cost_cat-id_ot-supp-line no-lock
     6770           on error undo, return error
     6771           :
     6772               delete temp_cost_cat-id_ot-supp-line.
     6773           end.
     6774           for each temp_cost_cli_ot-supp-line no-lock
     6775           on error undo, return error
